# A group fight, with violence_update on. In the temple (3001), with Hassan: Smokegod (60), Rambler (2, the leader,
# wearing wild flowers that are anti-evil, then made evil by Smokegod), Yeoman (5, with autoassist on) and a duck
# charmed to follow Rambler. Decimus (10) is in the group too, but waits in the temple square (3005). Three lizards
# (3710, level 2) assist their race. Rambler attacks one lizard, and then another:
# - each round, check_assist brings in Yeoman (autoassist) and the duck (charmed), and another lizard may join
#   against a random member of Rambler's group. The C picks it from the room's first character on through char_list
#   (vch->next), not the room, so Decimus next door can be picked: the lizard screams, and its attack misses the room
#   (#75)
# - the kill shares experience among the group in the room (the duck counts half its level), and each member's share
#   checks Rambler's gear for the flowers' zap, not the member's own: Yeoman, also wearing flowers and made evil,
#   keeps them (#75)
@updates area,violence
@connect god
Smokegod
smoke123
@return
@return
@connect dec
Decimus
psswrd
@return
@return
@connect yeo
Yeoman
psswrd
@return
@return
autoassist
@connect ram
Rambler
psswrd
@return
@return
@as god
load obj 304
give flowers rambler
load obj 304
give flowers yeoman
@as ram
wear flowers
@as yeo
wear flowers
@as god
set char rambler align -750
set char yeoman align -750
@as dec
follow rambler
@as yeo
follow rambler
@as ram
group decimus
group yeoman
@mob 3124 3001
@charm
@as dec
south
@as ram
@mob 3710 3001
@mob 3710 3001
@mob 3710 3001
kill lizard
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
kill lizard
@pulse until 400 is DEAD!!
@state
score
